      "text": "The dragon unleashes a swarm of insects that deals 14d6 piercing damage in a 40-foot cone (DC 34 basic Reflex save save) before dispersing. A creature that critically fails takes 2d6 persistent,poison damage. The dragon can't use Azure Swarm Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
